  "bio": "Dorotea Easter, based in Enskede, Sweden, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in fine line, illustrative, and vegan tattooing. Her work is well-known in the Stockholm area, particularly at Narval Studio in Sandsborg, where her professionalism and commitment to cleanliness ensure a safe and superb tattooing experience. Reach out to Dorotea via DM for inquiries and admire her meticulous artistry from Monday to Friday, between 10 am and 5 pm.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Enskede, Stockholm County, Sweden\n\nHelst kattueringar men gärna också tatueringar.\nSitter på @narval.studio Sandsborg/Stockholm.\nFör kontakt DM:a här.\nBusiness hours mån-fred 10-17!",
